agawlpan = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:body) (w:by the neck/by the throat) (d:<agawl>, his or her neck, and <pan>, from, written as one word: by the neck, at the throat, of seizing or strangling) (j:agawl/pan) (r:zd:15606) (q:draft)
agawm = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday/work) (w:in total/altogether/combined) (d:<a> and <gawm>, add together, written as one word: added together, placed before the sum; {avekpi agawm} is all in all) (j:a/gawm) (r:zd:16862/zd:22435) (q:draft)
