ahoihna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:advantage/good point/benefit/goodness) (d:<a> with <hoihna>, goodness, written as one word: the good in something, its advantage, set against <ahoihlohna> or {a siatna}, its harm) (j:a/hoihna) (r:zd:24157/zd:22650/zd:24068) (q:draft)
