ahonhon = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:social) (w:in groups/in crowds) (d:<a> and <honhon>, group upon group, written as one word; {ahonhon in} is in groups, many together) (j:a/honhon) (r:zd:12571/zd:11342) (q:draft)
