ahonsak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:open for/open up) (d:<a> and <honsak> written as one word: he or she opens something for someone, or the one that opens it; {lampi ahonsak} is open the way) (j:a/honsak) (r:zd:23977/zd:20181) (q:draft)
