akapkhit = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/politics) (w:after shooting/having shot) (d:<a>, <kap>, shoot, and <khit>, after, written as one word, used before <ciangin>: after he shot) (j:a/kap/khit) (r:zd:19348/zd:15840) (q:draft)
akapliam = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/politics) (w:shoot and wound/wound by shooting) (d:<a> and <kapliam> written as one word: he or they shot and wounded someone) (j:a/kapliam) (r:zd:16840) (q:draft)
akaplum = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/media) (w:shoot dead/kill by shooting) (d:<a> and <kaplum> written as one word: he or she shot someone dead, the one who shot dead) (j:a/kaplum) (r:zd:11389/zd:19353) (q:draft)
