akilawhgawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/health) (w:spread fiercely/break out) (d:<a> and <kilawhgawp> written as one word: of a fire or a disease, it spread badly) (j:a/kilawhgawp) (r:zd:15842/zd:17637) (q:draft)
