akimatkhiat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/media) (w:be caught/be arrested) (d:<aki> and <matkhiat> written as one word: he or they are caught, used before words such as <ciangin> and <theih>) (j:aki/matkhiat) (r:zd:16676/zd:19365) (q:draft)
