akituaklian = (i:1) (t:v) (f:time/everyday) (w:coincide/fit exactly/match exactly) (d:<a> and <kituaklian> written as one word: that falls at exactly the same time as something, or that fits it exactly; <tawh> marks the other thing) (j:a/kituaklian) (r:zd:15745/zd:23697) (q:draft)
