akituam = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/health) (w:be kept apart/be set apart) (d:<a> and <kituam> written as one word: kept apart from others, as in {akituam koih}, put in isolation) (j:a/kituam) (r:zd:23830) (q:draft)
akituangsak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/travel) (w:be put on/be printed on/be let ride) (d:<a>, the prefix <ki> and <tuangsak>, put on or let ride, written as one word: that has something placed on it, as a banknote on which a picture is printed; also of people who are let ride a vehicle) (j:a/ki/tuangsak) (r:zd:15956/zd:14633) (q:draft, low confidence)
akituat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:work) (w:be calculated/be valued/be reckoned) (d:<a> with the passive <ki> and <tuat>, calculate, written as one word, mostly as {akituat ciangin}: when it is worked out, when its value is reckoned) (j:a/ki/tuat) (r:zd:12140/zd:15296) (q:draft)
akituh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:compete/contend/scramble) (d:<a> and <kituh> written as one word: they compete for something or struggle with one another to get it; of seed, the one that is sown) (j:a/kituh) (r:zd:11064/zd:19441) (q:draft)
akitum = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:fight/come to blows) (d:<a> and <kitum> written as one word: they hit one another, they fight) (j:a/kitum) (r:zd:18014) (q:draft)
akitum = (i:2) (t:v) (f:media) (w:be played/be sounded) (d:<a> and <kitum> written as one word, of music: it is played on instruments) (j:a/kitum) (r:zd:11577) (q:draft, low confidence)
