akivulhnelh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/nature) (w:buried/buried under/that was buried) (d:<a> and the passive prefix <ki> with <vulhnelh>, cover over, written as one word: that was buried under earth or rubble, as in <vulhnelhkha> and <vulhnelhcip>) (j:a/ki/vulhnelh) (r:zd:15886) (q:draft, low confidence)
akiza = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/everyday) (w:be heard/be reported) (d:<a> and <kiza> written as one word: what is heard or reported, the news that has come in) (j:a/kiza) (r:zd:15447/zd:19964) (q:draft)
