akizak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/everyday) (w:be heard/be reported) (d:<a> and <kizak> written as one word, mostly before <ciangin>: when it was heard or reported) (j:a/kizak) (r:zd:20013/zd:20673) (q:draft)
