akizakna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media) (w:what is heard/report) (d:<a>, <kizak> and <na> written as one word: what has been heard; <akizakna ah> is according to what is reported) (j:a/kizak/na) (r:zd:15788/zd:12557) (q:draft)
