akizang = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:be used/that is used) (d:<a> and <kizang>, be used, written as one word: it is used, or before a noun the one that is used) (j:a/kizang) (r:zd:24213/zd:17834/ts:9033) (q:draft)
