akizangpen = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:the one used/what is used) (d:<akizang>, that is used, and the topic marker <pen> written as one word: as for what is used) (j:akizang/pen) (r:zd:20653/zd:19095) (q:draft)
