alengleng = (i:1) (t:v) (f:travel) (w:have been flying/fly about) (d:<a> and <lengleng> written as one word: it flies on and on or flies about, said of an aeroplane) (j:a/lengleng) (r:zd:15270/zd:15878) (q:draft)
