alenkhiatma = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:travel) (w:before takeoff/before it took off) (d:<alenkhiat>, it takes off, with <ma>, before, written as one word and often followed by <in>: before the aircraft takes off) (j:alenkhiat/ma) (r:zd:19807/zd:19495) (q:draft)
