alenkhiatzawh = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:travel) (w:after takeoff) (d:{a lenkhiat zawh} written as one word: after it took off, said of an aircraft; mostly followed by {asawtlo in}, not long after) (r:zd:11376/zd:21366) (q:draft)
