amathu = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:by oneself/on one's own/of one's own accord/spontaneously) (d:usually followed by <in>: by itself or by oneself, without the help or prompting of anyone else) (r:zd:12542/zd:15451/zd:17285) (q:draft)
