apek = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:flat/flat piece/plate) (d:<a> with a word for flat, written as one word: flat in shape, as against {a pum}, round; also a flat piece or plate of something) (r:zd:20786/zd:18181) (q:draft, low confidence)
