aphelkhiat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:take apart/open up/unwrap) (d:<a>, <phel>, take apart, and <khiat>, out, written as one word before <ciangin>: when it was opened up or taken apart) (j:a/phel/khiat) (r:zd:13262/zd:14822) (q:draft)
apheng = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday/media) (w:rashly/wildly/at random) (d:<a> and <pheng> written as one word, before a verb of speaking: without basis or care, as in {apheng gengawp}, talk wildly) (j:a/pheng) (r:zd:11587) (q:draft, low confidence)
aphi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education/everyday) (w:answer/result) (d:the answer to a question or a problem, and what comes back in return for what is done) (o:Burmese) (r:zd:12214/zd:25097) (q:draft, low confidence)
aphi = (i:2) (t:v) (f:education/work) (w:sit/take/answer) (d:<a> and <phi>, sit an examination or an interview, written as one word: he sits it, the one who sits it) (j:a/phi) (r:zd:16214) (q:draft, low confidence)
