asinlaitak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education) (w:be studying/be learning at the time) (d:<asin> and <laitak> written as one word: he or she is studying it at present, or while studying) (j:asin/laitak) (r:zd:11920/zd:16126) (q:draft)
asinsak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education) (w:teach/instruct) (d:<a> and <sinsak> written as one word: he or she teaches, or that which teaches) (j:a/sinsak) (r:zd:14787/zd:15811) (q:draft)
asinte = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education) (w:students/learners/those who study) (d:<asin> with the plural <te> written as one word: those who learn or study the subject named before it) (j:asin/te) (r:zd:22833/zd:12186) (q:draft)
asintheih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education) (w:can learn/be able to study) (d:<a> and <sintheih> written as one word: that he or she can learn or study) (j:a/sintheih) (r:zd:24275) (q:draft)
asinu = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/media) (w:the dead woman/the deceased) (d:<a> with <si>, die, and <nu>, woman, written as one word: the woman who died, said in reports of a death) (j:a/si/nu) (r:zd:18122/zd:11825) (q:draft)
asinuam = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/health) (w:one who wants to die) (d:<a> and <sinuam> written as one word: the person who wants to die) (j:a/sinuam) (r:zd:15437) (q:draft)
asipa = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/media) (w:the deceased/dead man) (d:<a> and <sipa> written as one word: the man who died, in news reports the man killed) (s:misipa) (j:a/sipa) (r:zd:11574/zd:12007/zd:19906) (q:draft)
asipah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:health/everyday) (w:die at once/die on the spot) (d:<a> and <sipah> written as one word: he or she died at once, or the one who died at once; {aphual ah asipah} is died on the spot) (j:a/sipah) (r:zd:21385/zd:16767) (q:draft)
asipen = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/everyday) (w:the dead/the one who died) (d:<a>, <si>, die, and the topic marker <pen> written as one word: as for the one or the ones who died) (j:a/si/pen) (r:zd:20562/zd:12811/zd:21563) (q:draft)
asisa = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/health) (w:dead/the dead one) (d:<a> and <sisa> written as one word: the one that has died; {asisa in} is dead, as in found dead or born dead) (j:a/sisa) (r:zd:16490/zd:15286/zd:11887) (q:draft)
asisan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:body/health) (w:his blood/her blood) (d:<a> and <sisan>, blood, written as one word: his, her or its blood) (j:a/sisan) (r:zd:12035/zd:15301) (q:draft)
