asiziau = (i:1) (t:v) (f:health/media) (w:die suddenly/die quickly) (d:<a>, <si>, die, and <ziau>, at once, written as one word: he or she died quickly or all of a sudden) (j:a/si/ziau) (r:zd:15498/zd:22097) (q:draft)
