atampen = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:the most/at most/the greatest number) (d:<a> and <tampen> written as one word: the most, the largest in number or amount; before a number, at most) (j:a/tampen) (r:zd:21042/zd:20363/zd:20093) (q:draft)
atampenna = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:the most/where most) (d:<atam>, many, and <penna>, most, written as one word: the most numerous, or the place where something is most numerous) (j:atam/penna) (r:zd:11308/zd:13173) (q:draft)
atampenpen = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:the most/the very most) (d:<a> with <tam>, many, and <penpen> written as one word: the greatest in number of all, the most) (j:a/tam/penpen) (r:zd:13000/zd:14686) (q:draft)
atamphadiak = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:especially many/most numerous) (d:<a> and <tamphadiak> written as one word: there are especially many, where they are most numerous) (j:a/tamphadiak) (r:zd:12161/zd:16708) (q:draft)
atamphadiakna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:where there are most/place of most) (d:<atam> and <phadiakna> written as one word: the place where something is especially many or frequent) (j:atam/phadiakna) (r:zd:15822/zd:16236) (q:draft)
atampian = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:fairly large amount/rather much) (d:<atam>, much, and <pian>, somewhat, written as one word: a rather large amount of something) (j:atam/pian) (r:zd:16869/zd:11920) (q:draft)
atamsemsem = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:become more and more/keep increasing) (d:<a> and <tamsemsem> written as one word: it grows in number all the time; also the growing number of something) (j:a/tamsemsem) (r:zd:15822/zd:13314) (q:draft)
