atangin = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:in great numbers/in bulk/wholesale) (d:<atang> and <in> written as one word; used in the pair {alom atangin} or {a lom atangin}, in heaps and in grains: in great numbers, in large amounts, all together) (j:atang/in) (r:zd:14826/ts:11738/zd:12112) (q:draft)
atangko = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/politics) (w:announce/proclaim/declare) (d:<a> and <tangko> written as one word: he announces, or what is announced) (j:a/tangko) (r:zd:19577/zd:21723) (q:draft)
