atangpha = (i:1) (t:v) (f:nature) (w:be bright/shine brightly) (d:<a> with {tang pha}, shine well, written as one word: it is bright, said of the moon; <taang> is shine) (r:zd:15011) (q:draft, low confidence)
atangpi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/everyday) (w:the general public/the whole/general) (d:the whole taken together, people in general; {atangpi thu in} is generally speaking, and {atangpi ading} is for everyone, for the common good) (r:zd:22502/zd:26444) (q:draft, low confidence)
atangthu = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/education) (w:his story/its history) (d:<a>, his, her or its, and <tangthu>, story, written as one word: the story or history of a person or people) (j:a/tangthu) (r:zd:20125/zd:14795) (q:draft)
atangtun = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/work) (w:be fulfilled/fulfil/accomplish/carry out) (d:<a> and <tangtun>, fulfil, written as one word: it is fulfilled or carried out, of an aim, a plan, a promise or a word) (j:a/tangtun) (r:zd:22719/zd:22331/zd:23742) (q:draft)
atangtung = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/religion) (w:come true/be fulfilled/succeed) (d:<a> and <tangtung> written as one word: it is fulfilled or carried through, said of a plan, a wish or a promise; with <sak>, bring it about) (j:a/tangtung) (r:zd:11133/zd:17760) (q:draft)
atangtunna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/politics) (w:its fulfilment/its accomplishment) (d:<a> and <tangtunna> written as one word: the carrying out or coming true of a plan, policy or purpose; {atangtunna dingin} is in order that it be carried out) (j:a/tangtunna) (r:zd:23742/zd:23670) (q:draft)
atangzai = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:wide/broad/extensive) (d:<a> and <tangzai> written as one word: what is wide or broad in scope) (j:a/tangzai) (r:zd:12341/zd:19676) (q:draft)
atankhiat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/health) (w:cut off/cut out) (d:<a> and <tankhiat> written as one word: he or they cut it off, or the thing that was cut off) (j:a/tankhiat) (r:zd:20535/zd:20320) (q:draft)
