azakha = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:happen to hear/hear of) (d:<a> and <zakha> written as one word: the one who happens to hear, those who come to hear of something; {azakha khempeuh} is all who heard of it) (j:a/zakha) (r:zd:11398/zd:25342/zd:14498) (q:draft)
