azaksak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:report/inform/notify) (d:<a> and <zaksak>, cause to hear, written as one word: he or they informed, often of reporting something to the police or the authorities) (j:a/zaksak) (r:zd:19289/zd:16733) (q:draft)
azaksakna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/everyday) (w:announcement/report/statement) (d:<a> and <zaksakna> written as one word: what he or she made known, his or her report) (j:a/zaksakna) (r:zd:16157) (q:draft)
