azan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:time) (w:night/by night) (d:<a> and <zan> written as one word: the night; {asun azan} is day and night, and {azan nitaklam} is the evening before) (j:a/zan) (r:zd:24948/zd:22580/ts:7679) (q:draft)
