azonkhit = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:finish searching/have searched) (d:<a>, <zon> and <khit> written as one word: they have finished searching; with {mateng in}, until they have finished searching) (j:a/zon/khit) (r:zd:12632/zd:15886) (q:draft)
azonsak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/work) (w:seek for/search/find for) (d:<a> and <zonsak> written as one word: he looks for something on behalf of another, or has a place searched) (j:a/zonsak) (r:zd:22030/zd:19912) (q:draft)
azonsan = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/politics) (w:search for/hunt for/pursue) (d:<a> with <zon>, seek, and the ending {-san}, after or toward, written as one word: be searching for someone, as the police for a suspect; {azonsan laitak} is are now searching for) (b:zon) (r:zd:17661/zd:18091) (q:draft)
azonzon = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:keep searching/search and search) (d:<a> and <zonzon>, keep searching, written as one word: he or they keep looking for, the one being sought) (j:a/zonzon) (r:zd:15491/zd:23935) (q:draft)
azu = (i:2) (t:n) (f:food) (w:liquor/alcohol/drink) (d:<zu>, strong drink, written together with <a>: the liquor, his or their drink; not the {azu} of {azu khan}, appeal) (s:zu) (b:zu) (r:zd:16968/zd:22775/zd:13276) (q:draft)
