Corinth = (i:1) (t:name) (c:book) (f:religion) (w:Corinthians/Corinth) (d:the English spelling of <Korin>, used in Bible references for the letters to the Corinthians: {Corinth masa} is First Corinthians) (o:English) (r:zd:23784/zd:19427) (q:draft)
