Corporal = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/work) (w:corporal) (d:a rank in the police or the army; also written before the name of the person) (o:English) (r:zd:11984/zd:14963) (q:draft)
correspondent = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media) (w:correspondent/reporter) (d:a reporter of a news agency stationed in a place, seen mostly after the name of the agency) (o:English) (r:zd:10695) (q:draft, low confidence)
Corridor = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home) (w:corridor/passage) (d:the open passage along the flats of a building or inside a shopping centre) (o:English) (r:zd:19788/zd:15019/zd:17884) (q:draft)
