counseling = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/social) (w:counseling/counselling) (d:talking with a trained or trusted person to get help with troubles of the mind or spirit) (o:English) (r:zd:12436/zd:23539) (q:draft)
counselling = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/social) (w:counselling/counseling) (d:talking with a trained helper about trouble of the mind or of life; also said as {thukuppihna} or <holimpihna>) (o:English) (r:zd:25170/zd:11376) (q:draft)
Counselor = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:counsellor/adviser) (d:a person who gives advice or counselling; also in the title State Counselor of Myanmar) (o:English) (r:zd:17055/zd:15237) (q:draft)
Counter = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/travel) (w:counter/desk) (d:the counter or desk where customers are served in a shop, hotel, bank or office) (o:English) (r:zd:23543/zd:17661/zd:22040) (q:draft)
County = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/travel) (w:county) (d:a county, a division of a state or province, written after its name) (o:English) (r:zd:24453/zd:15305) (q:draft)
course = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education) (w:course) (d:a course of study or training at a school, college or centre) (o:English) (r:zd:14554/zd:14856) (q:draft)
Court = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:court/law court) (d:a court of law, in the names of courts and beside the Zolai word <thukhenzum>) (s:thukhenzum) (o:English) (r:zd:24278/zd:11672/zd:19624) (q:draft)
