Covid = (i:1) (t:name) (f:health) (w:Covid-19/Covid) (d:the disease Covid-19, mostly written with the number, and the pandemic of 2020) (o:English) (r:zd:24635/zd:24250) (q:draft)
crackdown = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:crackdown/raid) (d:an operation by the authorities to find and arrest people, in the articles mostly workers without papers; with <bawl>, carry out a crackdown) (o:English) (r:zd:12587/zd:21968) (q:draft)
