critic = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/social) (w:criticism/critic) (d:criticism of a person or of the work of others, with <bawl> or <piak>; also a critic, as in {music critic}) (o:English) (r:zd:21369) (q:draft, low confidence)
critics = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/media) (w:criticism/criticise) (d:English plural critics used in Zolai text for criticism, the pointing out of faults of leaders, and with <uh> as a verb, criticise) (o:English) (r:zd:16661) (q:draft, low confidence)
Croatia = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:politics/travel) (w:Croatia) (d:a country in south-eastern Europe, a member of the European Union since 2013) (r:zd:20444/zd:25601) (q:draft)
Croydon = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (f:travel/social) (w:Croydon) (d:a suburb in the east of Melbourne in Australia where Zomi live; in the articles mostly in addresses) (r:zd:15519) (q:draft, low confidence)
