densukna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/travel) (w:crash down/being dashed down) (d:<den>, throw down, with <suk>, downward, and the noun ending <na>, written as one word and usually after <ki>: the act of being dashed down onto the ground or into a ravine) (j:den/suk/na) (r:zd:19939/zd:12696) (q:draft, low confidence)
dente = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:those who always) (d:<den> and <te> written as one word, after a verb: those who always or continually do it) (j:den/te) (r:zd:24069/zd:24276) (q:draft)
