dep = (i:2) (t:part) (f:everyday) (w:indeed/actually) (d:placed after the verb and before <hi> or {uh hi}, it marks what is said as notable or a little surprising, often with <bang> after the subject, as in {kei bang}, I for one; it is not the verb {dep}, choke) (r:zd:10912/zd:14910) (q:draft, low confidence)
