det = (i:2) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:regularly/steadily/constantly) (d:placed after a verb: doing it regularly or keeping on with it, as in {bawl det} do regularly; not the {det} of {kha det}, new moon) (r:zd:14734/zd:25343/zd:11714) (q:draft)
detail = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/work) (w:detailed/in detail) (d:English word used in {a detail in} and {detail takin}, in detail, point by point) (o:English) (r:zd:21219/zd:23993) (q:draft)
detding = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:should always/must firmly) (d:<det>, here firmly or constantly, placed after a verb, with <ding>: the action should be done steadily and without fail, as {phawk detding}, should always keep in mind) (r:zd:25927/zd:20547) (q:draft, low confidence)
