detna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (d:form of <den>, always, with the noun suffix {-na}, placed after a verb: the regular or constant doing of it, or the place where it is always done; {a bawl detna} is what is regularly made) (b:den) (r:zd:25027/zd:15998) (q:draft)
