deudeu = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:instead/rather/all the more/straight on) (d:placed after a verb: the action goes further than expected or the other way, rather, instead, simply going on to do it; perhaps <deuh> doubled) (r:zd:19603/zd:18927) (q:draft, low confidence)
