deuhse = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:rather/mostly/tend to) (d:<deuh> and <se> written as one word after a verb or describing word: rather so, more so than others, tending to be so) (j:deuh/se) (r:zd:11409/zd:12341) (q:draft, low confidence)
