dol = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:teak) (d:the teak tree and its wood; {dol kung} is a teak tree) (r:ts:3375) (q:draft, low confidence)
dollar = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work) (w:dollar) (d:the dollar as a unit of money, mostly the US dollar; the number follows the word, as in {dollar khat}, one dollar) (o:English) (r:zd:22451/zd:17162/zd:17025) (q:draft)
dollars = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work) (w:dollars) (d:the English plural of dollar, written before or after an amount of money) (o:English) (r:zd:21670/zd:25638) (q:draft)
dolsing = (i:1) (t:n) (c:plant) (f:nature/work) (w:teak/teak wood) (d:the teak tree and its timber, used for building) (r:zd:19676) (q:draft)
