dongmah = (i:1) (t:prep) (f:everyday/time) (w:right until/all the way to/up to) (d:<dong>, until, and the emphatic <mah> written as one word: right up to a time, a point or an amount; {tu dongmah} is up to this very day) (j:dong/mah) (r:zd:19245/zd:20997/zd:17666) (q:draft)
dongpah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:ask at once/question immediately) (d:<dong> and <pah> written as one word: ask or question right away) (j:dong/pah) (r:zd:14758) (q:draft)
