dongtang = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/social) (w:hindered/obstructed/bothered) (d:finding something in the way or a nuisance; {dongtang sak} is get in the way of someone, and {dongtang sa} is feel something to be a hindrance) (r:zd:15818/zd:17784) (q:draft, low confidence)
dongtuah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:be in distress/meet with hardship/be in trouble) (d:be in the middle of trouble, need or disaster; compare <tuah.2>, meet with; {cimawh dongtuah} is be in distress) (r:zd:12917/zd:25172/zd:22085) (q:draft, low confidence)
