donkik = (i:2) (t:v) (f:social/work) (w:contribute again/pay again) (d:pay a money contribution again for each new period; here <don> is to collect or put in money, as in <sum don>, and {donkik sum} is the recurring premium that the members of a mutual fund pay, not caring for someone again) (r:zd:25568) (q:draft, low confidence)
