encianna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/media) (w:inspection/examination/scrutiny) (d:<encian>, look carefully, with the noun suffix {-na}: a close inspection or check; {encianna nei} is carry out an inspection) (s:sittelna) (b:encian) (r:ts:9083/zd:18166) (q:draft)
