encikpah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:watch closely at once/keep an eye on immediately) (d:<encik> and <pah> written as one word: begin at once to watch or check someone closely) (j:encik/pah) (r:zd:15134/zd:11691) (q:draft)
