enkawmkawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/it) (w:while looking at/while watching) (d:<en> and <kawmkawm> written as one word: all the while looking at something, as a phone) (j:en/kawmkawm) (r:zd:17143/zd:14635) (q:draft)
