enn = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/everyday) (w:admire/envy/look up to) (d:look at someone with admiration or envy for what they are or have; {enn huai} is enviable, worth admiring; compare <eng>, envy, and <enhuai>) (r:zd:23706/zd:16340) (q:draft, low confidence)
