ensa = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/body) (w:looking at/facing) (d:<en>, look, with <sa>, in the state of having done so, written as one word and followed by <in>: while looking at, with the eyes turned to) (j:en/sa) (r:zd:21918/zd:20697) (q:draft)
