etneu = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:look down on/despise/belittle) (d:<et>, look at, with <neu>, small: regard a person as of little worth) (s:simmawh/enneu) (j:et/neu) (r:zd:12370/zd:20264) (q:draft)
