gai = (i:2) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:all/entirely/completely) (d:placed after a verb, the action reaches all of something or everyone, often with <khin> or {a vek in}: {sim gai} is read it all and {kibang gai lo} is not the same for all) (r:zd:16820/zd:24112/zd:20763) (q:draft)
