galhuhna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:military aid/military support/reinforcement) (d:<galhuh>, give military support, with the noun ending <na>: help given to a side in war, troops, weapons or money) (b:galhuh) (r:zd:25188) (q:draft)
