galkap kumpi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:military government/military regime/junta) (d:<galkap>, soldier, and <kumpi>, king or government: a government of the army, used of the military rulers of Myanmar; {galkap kumpi hun} is the time of military rule) (r:zd:22803/zd:24743) (q:draft)
