gensiatleh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:if one speaks ill of/when slandered) (d:<gensiat>, speak evil of, and <leh>, if, written as one word: if someone speaks badly of a person) (j:gensiat/leh) (r:zd:15376/zd:15006) (q:draft)
