guatna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/religion) (w:conferring/providing/bestowal) (d:<guat>, put upon or endow with, with the noun suffix <na>: the giving of a rank or of work to people; {nasep guatna} is job creation) (b:guat) (r:zd:24110/zd:12279) (q:draft, low confidence)
guatsak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:religion) (w:bestow/grant/endow with) (d:<guat>, put into or upon a person, with <sak>, do for another: of God, give health, peace or a state of mind to people; used in blessings and prayers) (j:guat/sak) (r:zd:11129/zd:9448) (q:draft)
guatuai = (i:1) (t:n) (c:plant) (f:food/nature) (w:bamboo shoot) (d:the young shoot of <gua>, bamboo, eaten fresh, dried as {guatuai keu} or fermented as {guatuai uih}) (r:zd:24276/zd:23037) (q:draft)
guhletang = (i:1) (t:n) (f:body/health) (w:bones/skeleton/frame) (d:<guh>, bone, <le>, and, and <tang> written as one word: the bones of the body as a whole, probably bones and joints) (r:zd:24276/zd:23443) (q:draft, low confidence)
gui = (i:3) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:string/cord/rope) (d:a string of a musical instrument, or a cord or rope; counted as {gui thum}, three strings, and found as rope in <guiawk>) (r:zd:19756) (q:draft, low confidence)
guiawk = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/health) (w:hang/hang oneself) (d:die or kill by a rope round the neck, from <gui>, here rope, and <awk>, be caught; {ki guiawk} is hang oneself) (r:zd:16849/zd:10842) (q:draft)
guicing = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/education) (w:complete/thorough/in full detail) (d:of an account or a matter: whole and in full detail; {a thu guicing in} is the matter in full, and {guicing tak} is thoroughly) (r:ts:12519/zd:20060) (q:draft, low confidence)
guideline = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/politics/health) (w:guideline) (d:a written set of directions issued by an authority on how something is to be done) (o:English) (r:zd:23594/zd:22654) (q:draft)
guidelines = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/politics) (w:guidelines) (d:official advice on what to do; the articles gloss it as <thukhun>) (o:English) (r:zd:25180/zd:24691) (q:draft, low confidence)
guihtheih = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/social) (w:intoxicant/drug/alcohol) (d:<guih> and <theih> written as one word, what can make drunk: drink or drugs that intoxicate, mostly in the pair <guihtheih khamtheih>, drugs and alcohol) (s:khamtheih) (j:guih/theih) (r:zd:20064/zd:14767/zd:13320) (q:draft)
guihtheih khamtheih = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/social) (w:intoxicants/drugs and alcohol/narcotics) (d:<guihtheih>, what can make drunk, and <khamtheih>, what can intoxicate, two words of like meaning set side by side: intoxicants of every kind, drugs and strong drink; the usual term for narcotic drugs in news and in teaching) (r:zd:14791/zd:14620/zd:21529) (q:draft)
guihtui = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (j:guahtui) (r:zd:12717/zd:12387/zd:11221) (q:draft, low confidence, seems to be a respelling of guahtui in reports of heavy rain and floods)
