guipi = (i:2) (t:n) (f:religion/social) (w:principle/fundamental/main point/basis) (d:the main line of a matter or a belief, on which the rest hangs: {thu guipi} is a main principle and {upna guipi} a fundamental doctrine of faith; not the stem of a plant or of life) (r:zd:20550/zd:21866/zd:20999) (q:draft)
