guk = (i:2) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:steal/do secretly/do by stealth) (d:form of <gu>, steal, not the number six: it stands before another verb for something done by stealth, as {guk lut}, enter secretly, and {guk sem}, work in secret, and after <ka> or <a> for the stealing itself) (r:ts:9570/zd:11375/zd:24104) (q:draft, low confidence)
gukdan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:way of stealing/how to steal) (d:<guk>, steal, with <dan>, way, written as one word: the way of stealing or how a theft was done) (j:guk/dan) (r:zd:22550) (q:draft, low confidence)
