guklut = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/travel) (w:sneak in/enter secretly/enter illegally) (d:the stem of <gu>, steal, with <lut>, enter: go into a place secretly or without permission) (r:ts:2731/zd:11207) (q:draft)
