gukna = (i:2) (t:n) (f:social) (w:theft/stealing) (d:<gu>, steal, in the form it takes before the noun ending {-na}: the act of stealing, as in {van gukna}, theft of goods; not the ordinal of <guk>, six) (r:zd:11786/zd:22550/zd:21608) (q:draft)
guksakpen = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:politics/media) (w:the theft/the stolen one) (d:<guksak>, steal from someone, with the topic marker <pen> written as one word: after <ki> the theft as the topic, after a noun the thing that was stolen) (j:guksak/pen) (r:zd:17884) (q:draft)
guksawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/media) (w:try to steal/attempt to abduct) (d:<guk>, here the form of <gu>, steal, and not the number six, with <sawm>, intend: try to steal a thing; of a person, try to abduct) (r:zd:15764/zd:14758/zd:14834) (q:draft)
guksep = (i:1) (t:v) (f:work) (w:work illegally/work in secret) (d:<guk> and <sep> written as one word: work by stealth, without a permit; {nasep guksep} is do a job illegally) (j:guk/sep) (r:zd:20012/zd:14704) (q:draft)
guktat = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:theft/stealing/acting by stealth) (d:<guk>, steal or do secretly, with <tat>, act: the doing of things by stealth, above all stealing; {guktat gamtatna} is the act of theft) (r:zd:15759/zd:12553) (q:draft, low confidence)
