gultawh = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:nature/everyday) (w:with a snake/like a snake) (d:<gul>, snake, and <tawh>, with, written as one word: with a snake or snakes; before <kibang>, like a snake) (j:gul/tawh) (r:zd:19493/zd:15732) (q:draft)
