gulut = (i:1) (t:v) (f:health) (w:be infected/be contaminated/be poisoned) (d:<gu>, poison, and <lut>, enter: poison or infection has got in, of a wound, a body or food; {gulut natna} is tetanus) (j:gu/lut) (r:zd:18058) (q:draft, low confidence)
