gum = (i:3) (t:v) (f:politics/social) (w:support/side with/back/defend) (d:take the side of a person, party or people and stand up for them, as in {na minam gum in}, stand by your people; {gum zaw} is favour one side more) (r:zd:24116/zd:23742/zd:22950) (q:draft)
gumzaw = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/politics) (w:favour more/side more with) (d:<gum> and <zaw> written as one word: take the side of one person more than of another) (j:gum/zaw) (r:zd:20930) (q:draft)
gundung = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/travel) (w:river/river course/length of a river) (d:<gun>, river, with <dung>, length: the course of a river along its length, and the land along it; a river name stands before it) (j:gun/dung) (r:zd:14869/zd:20494) (q:draft)
