gunpiau = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/travel) (w:riverbank/shore/coast) (d:<gun>, river, and <piau>, bank, written as one word: the bank of a river, and in one article the coast of the sea) (s:gungei) (j:gun/piau) (r:zd:20494/zd:25484) (q:draft)
gup = (i:2) (t:v) (f:politics/social) (w:support/back/side with) (d:take the side of a person, a party or a people and stand behind it; {gup tuam nei} is to have a side of one's own, {pum gup} is to back wholly, and {ei gup} is the one we support) (r:ts:301/zd:22950/zd:25127) (q:draft)
gup ngah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:religion) (w:be saved/receive salvation) (d:<gup>, save, and <ngah>, receive: receive salvation in the Christian sense; {gup ngah mi} is a saved person and {gup ngah nading} is in order to be saved) (r:zd:21939/zd:24503) (q:draft)
gupkhiatnathu = (i:1) (t:n) (f:religion) (w:message of salvation/word of salvation) (d:<gupkhiatna>, salvation, and <thu>, word, written as one word: the message or matter of salvation) (j:gupkhiatna/thu) (r:zd:21859) (q:draft, low confidence)
