haa = (i:2) (t:intj) (f:everyday) (w:ah/oh) (d:exclamation at the end of a line in songs and laments, adding feeling to what was said) (r:zd:17565/zd:17499) (q:draft, low confidence)
haai = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home/food) (j:hai) (r:zd:21003) (q:draft, low confidence)
haal = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/nature) (j:hal) (r:ts:479/zd:23767) (q:draft)
haam = (i:2) (t:n) (f:social) (w:speech/language/dialect) (d:the speech of a people, its language or dialect, mostly paired with <pau> in {pau le haam}; the long spelling of <ham.3>, not the cry of a bird) (s:pau) (r:ts:9859/zd:25573) (q:draft)
