habot = (i:1) (t:v) (f:health/body) (w:pull teeth/extract a tooth) (d:<ha>, tooth, and <bot>, pull out, written as one word: pull out a tooth; {tualvak habot te} are travelling tooth pullers and <habotna> is the pulling of a tooth) (j:ha/bot) (r:zd:15182) (q:draft)
habotna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/body) (w:tooth extraction/pulling of teeth) (d:<ha>, tooth, with <bot>, pull out, and the noun ending {-na}: the pulling out of a tooth; <habot> is one who pulls teeth) (r:zd:15182) (q:draft)
hack = (i:1) (t:v) (f:it) (w:hack) (d:break into a computer, a website or a network without permission; used with <sak> as {hack sak}) (o:English) (r:zd:15205/zd:12685) (q:draft)
