hai = (i:1) (t:n) (f:home/food) (w:cup/bowl) (d:a cup to drink from, or a small bowl) (q:draft)
haibang = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:social) (d:word of songs and poems used with <ngak>, wait: {haibang ngak} is wait for someone with longing; <hai> with <bang>, like, the image is not certain) (r:zd:16022/zd:24253) (q:draft, low confidence)
