Haiciin = (i:1) (t:name) (c:khua) (f:travel) (w:Haiciin) (d:village in the Tonzang area of Chin State, Myanmar) (r:zd:19293/ts:4885) (q:draft)
haigamtat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:act foolishly/behave badly/foolish behaviour) (d:<hai>, foolish, and <gamtat>, behave, written as one word: behave in a senseless or outrageous way; also said of such behaviour) (j:hai/gamtat) (r:zd:19548/zd:15579) (q:draft)
haih = (i:2) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:fail to recognise/not know/forget) (d:not know a person or thing again, or let it slip from mind: said of a face, of a friend who has changed, and with <ngeilo> of a custom that is never forgotten) (r:zd:15653/zd:23897/zd:10912) (q:draft)
haih = (i:3) (t:v) (f:health/family) (w:have pregnancy sickness/feel pregnant) (d:after <nau>, child: of a woman, feel the sickness and other signs of early pregnancy; {nau haih}) (r:zd:23479) (q:draft, low confidence)
haikhat = (i:1) (t:n) (f:food) (w:one cup/a cup of/a glass of) (d:<hai>, cup, and <khat>, one, written as one word after the name of a drink or other thing measured: one cup of it) (j:hai/khat) (r:zd:24276/zd:22650/zd:17015) (q:draft)
Hainan = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:travel) (w:Hainan) (d:island and province in the south of China) (r:zd:19495/zd:14648) (q:draft)
haisa = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:think foolish/consider stupid) (d:<hai>, foolish, with <sa>, consider or find: think someone or something foolish; {a haisa in} is seen in a saying where it seems to mean as a fool) (b:hai) (r:zd:14730/zd:19749) (q:draft, low confidence)
