hamciamna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/social) (w:effort/striving/endeavour) (d:<hamciam> with the noun ending <na>: effort, hard striving; the same as <hanciamna>) (s:hanciamna) (b:hamciam) (r:zd:16455/zd:22547) (q:draft)
hamdai = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/politics) (w:die down/quieten/be settled) (d:<ham>, speak, and <dai>, quiet, written as one word: of a matter or dispute, be talked of no more; {hamdai sak} is make a matter quiet, settle it) (j:ham/dai) (r:zd:25322/zd:18172) (q:draft, low confidence)
