Hanmun = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/religion) (w:cemetery/burial place) (d:<han>, grave, and <mun>, place, written as one word: the place where the dead are buried; in death notices, the place of burial) (s:hanmual) (j:han/mun) (r:zd:22577) (q:draft)
