hatlo = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/body) (w:not strong/weak) (d:<hat> and <lo> written as one word: not strong, weak; after a verb, not doing it much or often) (j:hat/lo) (r:zd:19271/zd:21081) (q:draft)
hatloh = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/body) (w:not strong/weak) (d:<hat>, strong, and <loh>, not, written as one word; the form of <hatlo> used before <man>, <hang> and in pairs such as {hat leh hatloh}, strong or not) (j:hat/loh) (r:zd:24276/zd:21383) (q:draft)
