hatlua = (i:2) (t:adj) (f:travel) (w:too fast/speeding) (d:of a vehicle or its driving, going too fast, after <mawtaw> or <meileng>; after <huih> the word means too strong) (r:zd:14689/zd:21316/zd:17677) (q:draft)
