haulo = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/work) (w:not rich/not having much) (d:<hau>, rich, and the negative <lo> written as one word: not rich; after a noun, not having much of it, as {mul haulo}, not hairy) (j:hau/lo) (r:zd:19269/zd:12998) (q:draft)
