hawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:food) (w:sip/drink) (d:drink a liquid in small mouthfuls, said of tea, hot water or soup: {niangtui hawp} is drink tea) (r:zd:22858/zd:24276) (q:draft)
hawpna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:food/health) (w:sipping/drinking/taking in) (d:<hawp>, sip, with the noun suffix {-na}: the drinking or drawing in of something, in the articles blood and oxygen) (b:hawp) (r:zd:17271) (q:draft, low confidence)
