huangin = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:home/everyday) (d:<huang>, enclosure or compound, with the marker <in> written as one word: the compound, its grounds, as the subject of the sentence) (j:huang/in) (r:zd:20627/zd:17053) (q:draft)
