huhsawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/everyday) (w:try to help/offer help/set about helping) (d:<huh>, help, and <sawm>, intend, written as one word: try or set out to help someone) (j:huh/sawm) (r:zd:23984/zd:18303) (q:draft)
