huhzawh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:be able to help/manage to help) (d:<huh>, help, and <zawh>, be able, written as one word: have the means or strength to help; {huhzawh zah} is as much as one can help) (j:huh/zawh) (r:zd:10874/zd:25928) (q:draft)
huhzawhna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:help/assistance/aid) (d:the help that one is able to give) (b:huhzawh) (r:ts:3085/zd:17060) (q:draft)
huih siangtho = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/health) (w:fresh air/clean air) (d:<huih>, air, and <siangtho>, here clean and pure, not holy: fresh, unpolluted air, also said of oxygen; often with the verb <diik>, breathe in) (r:zd:11571/zd:20778/zd:23729) (q:draft)
