huihdik = (i:1) (t:v) (f:body/health) (w:breathe/inhale/take a breath) (d:<huih>, air, with a short spelling of <diik>, draw in: breathe; also as a noun, breathing, as in {huihdik haksa}, difficulty in breathing) (s:naak) (r:zd:23848/zd:21807/zd:21616) (q:draft)
huihdikna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/body) (w:breathing/respiration) (d:{huih dik}, breathe in air, with the noun ending <na>: breathing; {huihdikna lampi} is the airway) (r:zd:20195/zd:21796) (q:draft)
huihhatna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:wind speed/wind strength/wind force) (d:<huih>, wind, and <hatna>, strength, written as one word: how strong or fast the wind blows) (j:huih/hatna) (r:zd:11956/zd:11236) (q:draft)
huihin = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:nature) (w:by the wind) (d:<huih>, wind, and <in>, the marker of the doer, written as one word: the wind as the one that blows something away or drives a fire) (j:huih/in) (r:zd:12717/zd:15679) (q:draft)
huihkhi = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:breeze/wind/air) (d:the moving air, a breeze; also used in songs and as a figure, as in {kikhelna huihkhi}, the wind of change) (s:huih) (r:zd:22784/zd:11494) (q:draft)
