huihnundan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/politics) (w:way the wind blows/climate/trend) (d:<huihnun> and <dan> written as one word: the way the wind blows, and so the climate or the trend of a country or of the times) (j:huihnun/dan) (r:zd:12033/zd:10966/zd:20316) (q:draft)
huihnunzia = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/social) (j:huihnun zia) (r:zd:11456/zd:24283) (q:draft)
