huihsia = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:storm/gale/violent wind) (d:<huih>, wind, with <sia>, bad: a violent wind; mostly in the pair {huihsia guahsia}, a storm of wind and rain) (s:huihpi) (r:zd:15942/zd:21563) (q:draft)
huihsiang = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/nature) (w:oxygen/fresh air) (d:<huih>, air, with <siang>, clean: clean fresh air, and the oxygen that the body needs to breathe) (s:oxygen) (r:zd:10842/zd:25115) (q:draft)
huihsiangtho = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health/nature) (w:oxygen/fresh air/clean air) (d:<huih> and <siangtho> written as one word: clean air to breathe, and the word used for oxygen) (j:huih/siangtho) (r:zd:19495/zd:12355/zd:19392) (q:draft)
huihtawh = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:nature) (w:with wind/with air) (d:<huih> and <tawh> written as one word: together with wind, or by means of air) (j:huih/tawh) (r:zd:15679/zd:19925) (q:draft)
