husa = (i:2) (t:n) (f:politics/social) (w:voice/say/influence) (d:the voice of a people or group as a force in public affairs, as in {mipi husa}, the voice of the public; it is called big or strong, not loud) (r:zd:12341/zd:15553) (q:draft, low confidence)
