ihthuak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:we suffer/we undergo) (d:<ih>, we, and <thuak> written as one word: we suffer, or before a noun what we suffer) (j:ih/thuak) (r:zd:24452/zd:25319) (q:draft)
