in = (i:2) (t:ppm) (f:everyday) (w:by) (d:marker placed after the subject or doer of an action, as in {khuami khat in gen hi}, a villager said; usually left untranslated, and distinct from {in} that marks place or time) (r:ts:11873/ts:11153/ts:12490) (q:draft)
