kanding = (i:1) (t:v) (f:media/everyday) (w:to investigate/to look into/to seek) (d:<kan>, search or inquire, and <ding>, will or in order to, written as one word: to look into a matter; {thuthang kanding in} is in order to get the news) (j:kan/ding) (r:zd:13084/zd:20050/zd:13046) (q:draft)
kane = (i:1) (t:v) (f:food/everyday) (w:I eat/I ate/I took) (d:<ka>, I, and <ne>, eat, written as one word: I eat, also of taking tablets) (j:ka/ne) (r:zd:15199/zd:19932) (q:draft)
kanei = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I have/we hold) (d:<ka>, I, and <nei>, have, written as one word; with a noun of action, I or we held it, as a service or a meeting) (j:ka/nei) (r:zd:20016/zd:12487/zd:20587) (q:draft)
kaneih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I have/that I have) (d:<ka> and <neih> written as one word: that I have or take; {zi kaneih} is my taking a wife) (j:ka/neih) (r:zd:20503/zd:12630/zd:24411) (q:draft)
kaneikei = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:I do not have/I have no) (d:<ka>, I, and <neikei>, not have, written as one word) (j:ka/neikei) (r:zd:15385/zd:15598) (q:draft)
kanek = (i:1) (t:v) (f:food/everyday) (w:I eat/I take) (d:<ka>, I, and <nek>, eat, written as one word: I eat or we eat, said also of taking medicine; the form used before words such as <ciangin> and <leh>) (j:ka/nek) (r:zd:11508/zd:25616) (q:draft)
kaneu = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:family/time) (w:when I was small) (d:<ka> and <neu> written as one word: I being small; mostly in {kaneu lai}, when I was a child, and {kaneu a kipan}, since I was small) (j:ka/neu) (r:zd:23661/zd:10660) (q:draft)
kaneutung = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:family/time) (w:my childhood/when I was small) (d:<ka> and <neutung> written as one word; {kaneutung akipan} is since I was small) (j:ka/neutung) (r:zd:13343/zd:14787) (q:draft)
