kangdeu = (i:1) (t:v) (f:health/body) (w:be scalded/be burnt/be scorched) (d:of skin, the mouth or a surface: be burnt or scalded by fire, heat or hot liquid; from <kang>, burn) (r:zd:15425/zd:13355) (q:draft, low confidence)
