kanih = (i:1) (t:num) (f:everyday) (w:the two of us/we two/both of us) (d:<ka> and <nih> written as one word: the two of us, the speaker and one other, followed by <un> or <vua>) (j:ka/nih) (r:zd:25572/zd:18002) (q:draft)
kanin = (i:2) (t:prep) (f:everyday) (w:than/more than) (d:placed after the thing compared, like <sangin>: more than, beyond; {nang kanin}, than you, {tulaitak hun kanin}, than the present time) (r:zd:19316/zd:25505) (q:draft)
kankawikawi = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:search around/inquire around/look everywhere) (d:<kan> and <kawikawi> written as one word: search or ask here and there) (j:kan/kawikawi) (r:zd:12264/zd:10733) (q:draft)
kankhiading = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/everyday) (w:will investigate/will find out) (d:<kankhia> and the future marker <ding> written as one word: will search a matter out, will investigate) (j:kankhia/ding) (r:zd:16688/zd:18014/zd:15830) (q:draft)
