kapu = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family) (w:my grandfather/my forefather) (d:<ka> and <pu> written as one word: my grandfather; {kapu kapa te} is my forefathers, and before a name it is said with respect of an older man of the family) (j:ka/pu) (r:zd:16651/zd:15344) (q:draft)
