lamzikpitung = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:travel) (w:on the highway/on the main road) (d:<lamzikpi>, main road or highway, and <tung>, on, written as one word: on the road named, along the highway) (j:lamzikpi/tung) (r:zd:15913/zd:21020/zd:19082) (q:draft)
lamziktung = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:travel) (w:on the road/on the street) (d:<lamzik>, road, and <tung>, on, written as one word, often after the name of a road and before <ah>) (j:lamzik/tung) (r:zd:11234/zd:12304) (q:draft)
lamzing = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:street/lane/side road) (d:a street or lane of a town, named after the street name, as in {Zawtika lamzing}; also the lane of a road a vehicle runs in) (r:zd:11201/zd:11368) (q:draft, low confidence)
