lang = (i:3) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:be visible/be evident/stand out) (d:as a verb, be clearly seen or prominent, as in {a lang mahmah}, very prominent; with the prefix {ki-} it is <kilang>, appear) (r:zd:22704) (q:draft, low confidence)
