lanlan = (i:2) (t:adv) (f:everyday/social) (w:boldly/confidently/outright) (d:after a verb of saying or doing such as <ci> or <kici>, said or done openly and with full assurance, often more than is warranted; the stately walk of the other sense is not meant) (r:zd:26591/zd:16997/zd:23890) (q:draft)
