Liter = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/work) (w:liter/litre) (d:the unit for measuring liquids such as water and fuel; the number follows it, as {liter 4}, four liters) (o:English) (r:zd:24276/zd:13171) (q:draft)
Lithuania = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:politics/travel) (w:Lithuania) (d:country in northern Europe, on the Baltic Sea) (r:zd:25918/zd:16997) (q:draft)
litlet = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:neatly/tidily/in good order) (d:placed after a verb or describing word: in a neat, orderly and complete way; {om litlet} is be there intact and in order) (r:zd:17442/zd:12976/ts:301) (q:draft)
