liuleu = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:completely/clean off/outright) (d:placed after a verb of cutting off, separating, overturning or dying: the thing is wholly severed or lies there finished) (r:zd:22540/zd:13159) (q:draft, low confidence)
