lolzaw = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:earlier/too early) (d:<lol>, early, and <zaw>, more, written as one word: earlier than the set time, mostly followed by <in>) (j:lol/zaw) (r:zd:19712/zd:16229) (q:draft)
