lopawi = (i:2) (t:n) (f:work/nature) (w:field preparation/clearing of the field) (d:a stage of work on the hill field, <lo>, that is finished about April, before the Sialsawm feast, and is named beside and before <khaituh>, the sowing of seed; {lopawi khit} is after this work is done) (r:zd:23129/zd:26708) (q:draft, low confidence)
