luttheihnading = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:travel/politics) (w:in order to enter/for entry) (d:<luttheih>, be able to enter, and <nading>, for, written as one word: so that one may enter, for being admitted to a country) (j:luttheih/nading) (r:zd:11010/zd:11115) (q:draft)
luttheilo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/travel) (w:cannot enter/unable to go in) (d:<lut> and <theilo> written as one word: not able to enter or go in) (j:lut/theilo) (r:zd:12717/zd:12302) (q:draft)
lutto = (i:1) (t:v) (f:travel/everyday) (w:go up into/enter/advance into) (d:<lut>, enter, with <to>, upward: go in and up, come up into a place) (j:lut/to) (r:zd:10912/zd:15456/zd:25165) (q:draft)
lutzo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/travel) (w:get in/manage to enter) (d:<lut>, enter, and <zo>, be able, written as one word: succeed in entering a place or in being admitted to a body) (j:lut/zo) (r:ts:10538/zd:19239) (q:draft)
