manbang = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:work) (w:worth about/to the value of about) (d:<man> in its meaning price and <bang> in its meaning about, written as one word after a sum of money: about that much in value) (j:man/bang) (r:zd:20466/zd:11138) (q:draft)
