minam kician = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/social) (w:established nation/recognised people/people in its own right) (d:<minam>, a people or nation, and <kician>, firm, well-founded: a people that stands as a full nation in its own right, with its own name, language and recognition; often with <khat> after it and a people's name before it, {Zomi minam kician khat}) (r:zd:21815/zd:23762) (q:draft)
minam party = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:ethnic party/ethnic political party) (d:<minam>, a people or ethnic group, and <party>, political party: a political party that stands for one ethnic group, as against a party of the whole country; a term of the politics of Myanmar) (r:zd:22989/zd:23011/zd:22365) (q:draft)
