minamdang = (i:3) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:other ethnic group/another people/other nationality) (d:a people or ethnic group other than one’s own, also one living in the same country, as the non-Zomi peoples of Myanmar; not only a foreigner from abroad) (r:zd:12336/zd:14992/zd:9425) (q:draft)
minamke = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:sub-tribe/ethnic subgroup/branch of a people) (d:one of the branches into which a people, <minam>, divides; paired with {pauke}, a branch of a language) (b:minam) (r:zd:16342/zd:24009) (q:draft, low confidence)
minamkee = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:sub-tribe/ethnic subgroup/branch of a people) (d:<minam> people with {kee}, branch: one of the smaller groups into which a people is divided, each often with its own speech) (r:zd:22802/zd:16509) (q:draft, low confidence)
minamkhat = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/politics) (w:one people/a nation/a people) (d:<minam>, people, and <khat>, one, written as one word: a people or nation, one people) (j:minam/khat) (r:zd:25866) (q:draft)
