munzong = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:also a place/place too) (d:<mun>, place, and <zong>, also, written as one word, mostly after a verb form in {-na}: it is also a place where something is so) (j:mun/zong) (r:zd:19383/zd:20734) (q:draft)
