nabeina = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/social) (w:your expenses/what you have spent) (d:<na>, your, and <beina> written as one word: what you have used up or spent, in a blessing on someone who has given) (j:na/beina) (r:zd:11224) (q:draft)
