nadong = (i:1) (t:ppm) (f:everyday) (w:even/as far as/up to) (d:placed after a noun or place: even that, as far as that; apparently <na> with <dong>, until, written as one word) (j:na/dong) (r:zd:9433/zd:9429) (q:draft, low confidence)
