nekpak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:food) (w:eat right away/eat for the moment) (d:<nek>, eat, and <pak>, at once or for a short while, written as one word: eating at the time, what is eaten for the moment) (j:nek/pak) (r:zd:20946) (q:draft, low confidence)
nekpen = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:food) (w:eating) (d:<nek>, eat, with the topic marker <pen>, written as one word: the eating of the thing named, as the topic of the sentence) (j:nek/pen) (r:zd:11508/zd:19327) (q:draft)
neksawm = (i:1) (t:v) (f:food) (w:try to eat/be about to eat/mean to eat) (d:<nek> and <sawm> written as one word: intend or try to eat something, be about to eat it) (j:nek/sawm) (r:zd:21954/zd:23204) (q:draft)
neksim = (i:2) (t:v) (f:politics/work) (w:embezzle/misappropriate) (d:take public or entrusted money for oneself in secret, with <sum>, money, or a budget as its object; a present-day figurative use of eating in secret, often paired with <ipsim>) (r:zd:21105/zd:20676) (q:draft)
neksimna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/work) (w:embezzlement/misappropriation/corruption) (d:<neksim>, eat in secret, with the noun ending {-na}: secretly taking for oneself money or property held in trust; {sum neksimna} is embezzlement of money) (b:neksim) (r:zd:19801/zd:19671) (q:draft)
neksimvai = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:corruption case/embezzlement case) (d:<neksim>, embezzle, and <vai>, matter, written as one word: a matter or case of embezzlement, here after {sum golhguk}) (j:neksim/vai) (r:zd:20367/zd:20676) (q:draft)
nektawmding = (i:1) (t:n) (f:food/everyday) (w:food to eat/provisions/living) (d:<nektawm>, food, and <ding>, for, written as one word: something to eat, food supplies, and so the means to live; {nektawmding zong} is seek a living) (j:nektawm/ding) (r:zd:12728/zd:14638/zd:15054) (q:draft)
