nektheihna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:food) (w:being able to eat/where one can eat) (d:<nek>, eat, and <theihna>, ability, written as one word: being able to eat something, or the place or means of eating it) (j:nek/theihna) (r:zd:19859/zd:16696) (q:draft)
