oratorio = (i:1) (t:n) (f:religion/media) (w:oratorio) (d:a long musical work for singers and orchestra on a sacred subject) (o:English) (r:zd:9252) (q:draft, low confidence)
orbit = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature/it) (w:orbit) (d:the path of a satellite around the earth or of a body in space; in Zolai explained with <kimkot>, go around) (o:English) (r:zd:11292/zd:10917) (q:draft)
order = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics/work) (w:order/command) (d:an order given by one who has authority; {order pia} is give an order) (o:English) (r:zd:24714/zd:24111) (q:draft)
