papikhinsa = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family/social) (w:grown man/man of mature age) (d:<papi> and <khinsa> written as one word: one who is already a grown man) (j:papi/khinsa) (r:zd:20363) (q:draft, low confidence)
papipa = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family/social) (w:man/older man) (d:<papi>, grown man, with <pa>: the man, said of one grown or older man already mentioned; paired with <nupinu>, the woman) (b:papi) (r:zd:21047/zd:22683/zd:19468) (q:draft)
