Paradise = (i:1) (t:name) (c:place) (f:religion) (j:Paradais) (o:English) (r:zd:25222) (q:draft)
Paralysis = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health) (w:paralysis) (d:loss of the power to move a part of the body; explained in Zolai as {pumpi zaw natna}) (o:English) (r:zd:11150) (q:draft, low confidence)
Paramedic = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health) (w:paramedic) (d:a member of an ambulance crew trained to give emergency care; written with a capital in the articles) (o:English) (r:zd:19810) (q:draft, low confidence)
Paramedics = (i:1) (t:n) (f:health) (w:paramedic/ambulance crew) (d:the emergency medical workers who come with an ambulance; used in the English plural form, usually followed by <te>) (o:English) (r:zd:13188/zd:15307/zd:17483) (q:draft)
parcel = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/travel) (w:parcel/package) (d:a package sent by post or courier; {parcel tawh khak} is send by parcel) (o:English) (r:zd:26097/zd:21540/zd:21908) (q:draft)
Paris = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (f:travel) (w:Paris) (d:the capital city of France) (r:zd:17632/zd:12873) (q:draft)
Parking = (i:1) (t:n) (f:travel) (w:parking/parking place) (d:the parking of a vehicle or the place for it; {Parking koih} is park a vehicle, and {Parking akikoih mawtaw} is a parked car) (o:English) (r:zd:14509/zd:12691/zd:17075) (q:draft)
Parkland = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (f:media) (w:Parkland) (d:a city in Florida in the United States, named in the articles for the 2018 school shooting there) (r:zd:17750) (q:draft)
Parliament = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:parliament) (d:the assembly of elected members that makes the laws of a country or state) (o:English) (r:zd:11117/zd:23013/zd:22818) (q:draft)
partner = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/work) (w:partner) (d:a person or organisation one lives, works or prays together with; {prayer partner} is one who prays with and for someone) (o:English) (r:zd:25178/zd:15554/zd:25305) (q:draft, low confidence)
parttime = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:work) (w:part-time) (d:for only part of the working day or week; {parttime sem} is work part-time) (o:English) (r:ts:3125/zd:20176) (q:draft)
party = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:party/political party) (o:English) (r:zd:24682/zd:22989) (q:draft)
partyte = (i:1) (t:n) (f:politics) (w:parties/political parties) (d:the English loan <party> with the plural <te>: political parties, or the people of a party) (b:party) (o:English) (r:zd:24354/zd:22701) (q:draft)
