pattahzia = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family/education) (w:way of training/upbringing/way of raising) (d:<pattah>, train, and <zia>, way, written as one word: the way a child or young one is trained) (j:pattah/zia) (r:zd:24079/zd:13266) (q:draft)
