pauh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:win a lottery/hit) (d:of a lottery ticket or its holder, win: {Aungbali pauh} and {thi pauh} are win the lottery) (o:Burmese) (r:zd:17599) (q:draft, low confidence)
