pautawh = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:social/education) (w:in the language/in the speech of) (d:<pau>, language, and <tawh>, with, written as one word after the name of a language: in that language) (j:pau/tawh) (r:zd:20676/zd:15125) (q:draft)
