piangsaklo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/health) (w:not cause/not bring about) (d:<piangsak>, cause, and <lo>, not, written as one word: does not cause or produce it) (j:piangsak/lo) (r:zd:14826/zd:13230) (q:draft)
piangsakpah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:cause at once/bring about immediately) (d:<piangsak>, bring about, and <pah>, at once, written as one word) (j:piangsak/pah) (r:zd:13332/zd:18028) (q:draft)
