piangthu = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:event/happening/occurrence) (d:<piang>, happen, with <thu>, matter, written as one word: a thing that happens, usually as {a piangthu}) (j:piang/thu) (r:zd:24276/zd:20682) (q:draft)
piangto = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:arise/develop/grow to be) (d:<piang>, come into being, and <to>, onward, written as one word: come about step by step, grow into something) (j:piang/to) (r:zd:26049/zd:22116) (q:draft)
piangzolo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:cannot happen/cannot come about/cannot be produced) (d:<piangzo>, can happen, and <lo>, not, written as one word: unable to come about or to be produced) (j:piangzo/lo) (r:zd:19875/zd:23843) (q:draft)
pianin = (i:2) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:somewhat/rather/in a way) (d:the softening word <pian>, somewhat, with the ending {-in}: in a manner that is rather so or seems so, after a describing word or after <dan> and <bang>, as in {ciamnuih dan pianin}, in a rather joking way; not the birth of {pianin}, by birth) (r:zd:11653/zd:15571/zd:17055) (q:draft)
