piankhat = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:a rather/a somewhat) (d:<pian>, somewhat, and <khat>, one, written as one word after a describing word: one that is rather so; {ahoih piankhat} is a fairly good one) (j:pian/khat) (r:zd:10743/zd:17568) (q:draft)
