piannopdan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:what one wants to become/the way one wants to be) (d:<piannop> and <dan> written as one word: the way one wishes to be or to turn out) (j:piannop/dan) (r:zd:20725/zd:22116) (q:draft)
