pianpah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:happen at once/come about immediately) (d:<pian> and <pah> written as one word: come about right away; in other sentences <pian> after a verb seems to mean somewhat, rather) (j:pian/pah) (r:zd:21989) (q:draft, low confidence)
