pidan = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education/home) (w:ruler/measuring stick) (d:a ruler for measuring length, also used of a standard by which something is judged) (o:Burmese) (r:zd:23767/zd:12370) (q:draft)
piengsak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (j:piangsak) (r:zd:24176/zd:24167) (q:draft)
pih = (i:2) (t:part) (f:social/family) (w:fellow) (d:placed after a noun for a person who shares it with one: {Zomi pih} is a fellow Zomi and {innkuan pih} a member of the same household; after a verb {pih} is do together with) (r:zd:25461/zd:22023) (q:draft)
pihding = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (w:will do with/to do with) (d:the verb suffix <pih>, together with or for someone, and <ding> written as one word after a verb: will do it with or for someone, or someone to do it with) (j:pih/ding) (r:zd:19676/zd:15588/zd:17421) (q:draft)
pihhi = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (d:<pih>, the verb suffix for doing something together with or for someone, and the sentence-final <hi> written as one word) (j:pih/hi) (r:zd:12634) (q:draft, low confidence)
pihlo = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (d:the verb suffix <pih>, together with or for someone, and <lo>, not, written as one word after a verb: not do it with or for someone, as {thukim pihlo}, not agree with) (j:pih/lo) (r:zd:20125/zd:22938) (q:draft)
pihloh = (i:1) (t:part) (f:social/politics) (d:<pih>, do together with, and <loh>, not, written as one word after a verb: {thukim pihloh} is without agreeing to it, {theih pihloh} is not recognised) (j:pih/loh) (r:zd:22926) (q:draft, low confidence)
pihnuam = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:want to join in/want to do with) (d:<pih>, do together with, and <nuam>, want, written as one word after a verb: {pan pihnuam} is want to take part with others) (j:pih/nuam) (r:zd:23833) (q:draft, low confidence)
pihpen = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:the one with whom) (d:the verb suffix <pih>, together with, and the topic marker <pen> written as one word: the one with whom the action was done, as the topic of the sentence) (j:pih/pen) (r:zd:24320) (q:draft, low confidence)
pihpih = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (d:<pih> doubled after a verb: keep on doing the action with, to or for someone, as in {kiho pihpih}, kept talking with her) (b:pih) (r:zd:12992/zd:17070/zd:15570) (q:draft, low confidence)
pihteng = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family/social) (w:all the members/everyone of) (d:<pih>, fellow, with <teng>, all, written as one word after a noun: all who belong to it; {innkuan pihteng} is all the members of the family) (j:pih/teng) (r:zd:14652/zd:22203) (q:draft)
pii = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family/everyday) (j:pi) (r:zd:22203) (q:draft, low confidence)
piicing = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:social) (j:picing) (r:zd:25221/zd:25394) (q:draft)
