pilvan = (i:2) (t:v) (f:everyday/social) (w:be careful/be watchful/be alert) (d:short form of <pilvang> before words such as <huai>, <kisam>, <mahmah> and <ding>: take care and stay on guard in what one says and does; nothing is said of waking from drink) (b:pilvang) (r:zd:9425/zd:24217/zd:20172) (q:draft)
pilvangding = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday/social) (w:to be careful/to be alert/to be watchful) (d:<pilvang>, be alert, and <ding>, to, written as one word: that one should take care, often before {thupi hi} or {kisam hi}) (j:pilvang/ding) (r:zd:15608/zd:15529/zd:11117) (q:draft)
pilvanghuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:calling for caution/to be wary of) (d:<pilvang>, be alert, with <huai>: such that one should be careful or on guard) (j:pilvang/huai) (r:zd:12444/zd:17301) (q:draft)
pilvangna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:alertness/vigilance/caution/prudence) (d:<pilvang>, be alert, with the noun suffix {-na}: watchfulness and care; {pilvangna ding} is something to be careful about, a warning) (b:pilvang) (r:ts:11223/zd:22639) (q:draft)
pilvangtak = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:alertly/watchfully/carefully/wisely) (d:<pilvang>, be alert, with <tak>, which makes an adverb, mostly followed by <in>: in a watchful and careful way) (b:pilvang) (j:pilvang/tak) (r:zd:23629/zd:20875) (q:draft)
pilvangtakin = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:carefully/wisely/watchfully) (d:<pilvangtak> and <in> written as one word: in a careful and wise way) (j:pilvangtak/in) (r:zd:24248/zd:20406) (q:draft)
pilvanhuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/social) (w:calling for caution/to be wary of) (d:<pilvang> be alert with <huai>, needing to be done: something about which one must be watchful and careful) (s:kidophuai) (b:pilvang) (r:zd:20060/zd:11135) (q:draft)
pilvanna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social/everyday) (w:prudence/alertness/wisdom) (d:<pilvang>, be alert, with the noun ending {-na}: being watchful and sensible in dealing with people and events) (b:pilvang) (r:zd:15818) (q:draft, low confidence)
Pimpih = (i:1) (t:name) (c:khua) (f:travel) (w:Pimpih) (d:a Zomi village in the Tedim area of Chin State; after a personal name it tells the home village) (r:zd:16139/zd:25189) (q:draft)
pimuh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social) (w:esteem/regard highly/look up to) (d:see someone as great, hold in high regard; {ki pimuh} is think highly of oneself) (a:simmawh) (r:zd:23257/zd:23830/zd:24202) (q:draft)
pin = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:although/even though) (d:in {na pin}, a way of writing {napi-in}, from <napi>, although: placed after a verb, even though this is so) (r:zd:22441/ts:7051) (q:draft, low confidence)
