pipi mah = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:even though/in spite of) (d:<pipi>, very, and <mah>, emphasis: placed after a negated verb or describing word, often followed by <in>, even while not, in spite of not; {neilo pipi mah in} is even though having nothing) (r:zd:10761/zd:16376/zd:25932) (q:draft)
