qualification = (i:1) (t:n) (f:work/education) (w:qualification) (d:the training, certificate or ability that makes someone fit for a post) (o:English) (r:zd:21843/zd:24313) (q:draft)
qualified = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:work/education) (w:qualified/competent) (d:having the training or ability that a task or post requires) (o:English) (r:zd:22989/zd:25047/zd:20145) (q:draft)
