sangkhin = (i:1) (t:v) (f:religion/social) (w:have already accepted/already received) (d:<sang.5>, accept, and <khin>, already, written as one word: have already accepted a person or an invitation) (j:sang/khin) (r:zd:12289/zd:25106) (q:draft)
