sanglo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:social/religion) (w:not accept/reject/refuse) (d:<saang>, accept, here spelled with a short vowel, and <lo>, not, written as one word: not accept or admit a person, a request or a teaching) (j:saang/lo) (r:zd:17051/zd:23441/zd:25178) (q:draft)
sanglo = (i:2) (t:adj) (f:everyday) (w:not high/low) (d:<sang>, high, and <lo>, not, written as one word: not high) (j:sang/lo) (r:zd:25919) (q:draft, low confidence)
