singtung = (i:1) (t:n) (f:nature) (w:treetop/top of a tree) (d:<sing>, tree, and <tung>, on, written as one word: the upper part of a tree; {singtung ah} is up in a tree, on a tree) (j:sing/tung) (r:zd:23616/zd:23928) (q:draft, low confidence)
