sinhna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education) (j:sinna) (r:zd:22922) (q:draft, low confidence)
sinhsenh = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (j:sinsen) (r:zd:25400) (q:draft, low confidence)
sinhuai = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:education/everyday) (w:worth learning/instructive) (d:<sin>, learn, and <huai> written as one word: that ought to be learned, that one can learn from) (j:sin/huai) (r:zd:23301/zd:22157/zd:12867) (q:draft)
