sinkhiat = (i:2) (t:v) (f:education/everyday) (w:learn from/draw a lesson/learn) (d:<sin>, learn, with <khiat>, out: draw a lesson or knowledge out of an experience or a source, often after <pan>, from; not the shaking of a thing) (r:zd:16625/zd:21340/zd:24375) (q:draft)
sinkhin = (i:1) (t:v) (f:education) (w:have learned/have studied) (d:<sin>, learn, and <khin>, already, written as one word: have already learned or finished studying) (j:sin/khin) (r:zd:19117/zd:17651) (q:draft)
