talent = (i:1) (t:n) (f:education/religion) (w:talent/gift/ability) (d:a natural ability that a person has, often spoken of as given by God; {Talent Show} is a show of such abilities) (s:siamna) (o:English) (r:zd:24381/zd:24393/zd:12961) (q:draft)
taleuleu = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:again/in turn/on the other hand) (d:the particle <ta> and <leuleu>, again, written as one word, mostly after a verb: once more, or in turn, as the other side of what was just said) (j:ta/leuleu) (r:zd:24977/zd:25569) (q:draft)
