talkaih = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:drag/drag along) (d:pull along the ground, of a vehicle dragging a person, of feet that shuffle, and of events or a ruler carrying people along by force) (r:zd:11913/zd:21134) (q:draft, low confidence)
