tammaw = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (w:I wonder/could it be) (d:{tam maw} written as one word, at the end of a sentence: marks a wondering or doubtful question, I wonder whether; the second part is <maw>) (r:zd:16442/zd:11721/zd:24604) (q:draft)
tammuh = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:see often/be common) (d:<tam>, many, and <muh>, see, written as one word; with <ki> before it, be seen a lot, be common) (j:tam/muh) (r:zd:19423) (q:draft, low confidence)
tamnei = (i:1) (t:v) (f:work/everyday) (w:have much/have many) (d:<tam>, many, and <nei>, have, written as one word after the thing owned) (j:tam/nei) (r:zd:25919/zd:15983) (q:draft)
tamnek = (i:1) (t:v) (f:food/health) (w:eat much/eat a lot) (d:<tam>, many, with <nek>, eat, written as one word: eat a great deal of something; {tamnek kei in} is do not eat much) (j:tam/nek) (r:zd:20814/zd:21032/zd:21974) (q:draft)
tamngah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:get much/receive a lot) (d:<tam> and <ngah> written as one word: get much; with <zaw>, get more, and with <pen>, get the most) (j:tam/ngah) (r:zd:11023/zd:22964) (q:draft)
