tampitakte = (i:1) (t:pron) (f:everyday) (w:very many/a great many) (d:<tampitak> very many with the plural <te>, written as one word: a great many people or things, also after a noun) (b:tampitak) (r:zd:25094/zd:12333) (q:draft)
tampitawh = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:with many/with much) (d:<tampi>, many, and <tawh>, with, written as one word after a noun: with many of them, with a great deal of it) (j:tampi/tawh) (r:zd:11450/zd:25097) (q:draft)
