tamvei = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday/time) (w:many times/often/frequently) (d:<tam> many, with <vei>, time or occasion; {tamvei zaw} is more times) (s:tamveipi/zelzel) (q:draft)
tamveipitak = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday/time) (w:very many times/very often) (d:<tamveipi>, many times, and <tak> written as one word: a great many times, again and again) (j:tamveipi/tak) (r:zd:21954/zd:14549) (q:draft)
