Tennis = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media) (w:tennis) (d:the game of tennis; mostly in the English name Table Tennis, table tennis) (o:English) (r:zd:24141/zd:23005) (q:draft)
tenor = (i:1) (t:n) (f:media/religion) (w:tenor) (d:the tenor voice or part in singing, named with soprano, alto and bass) (o:English) (r:zd:11657/zd:9430) (q:draft, low confidence)
