tentanna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:persistence/insistence/obstinacy) (d:<tentan>, persistently, with the noun suffix {-na}, placed after a verb: the fact of keeping on doing it without yielding) (b:tentan) (r:zd:21869/ts:397) (q:draft)
tenten = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:persistently/stubbornly) (d:after a verb, apparently that the doing goes on insistently and does not stop; {do tenten} seems to be keep on fighting and {ci tenten} keep on saying) (r:zd:20730/zd:25264) (q:draft, low confidence)
tenzong = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:those also/they too) (d:<ten> and <zong> written as one word: the people named, as the doers, also) (j:ten/zong) (r:zd:25928) (q:draft)
tep = (i:3) (t:v) (f:body/health) (w:suck/smoke/sip) (d:draw into the mouth: after <zatep>, tobacco, also written {za tep}, smoke; after <nawi>, of a baby, suck the breast; after <zu>, sip; often paired with <muam>, hold in the mouth, as {tep leh muam}, smoking and chewing) (r:zd:24276/zd:24117/zd:23773) (q:draft)
tepan = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday/media) (w:from) (d:<te> and <pan> written as one word after a plural noun: from them, from those named, as in {News tepan kiza hi}, it is heard from the news agencies) (j:te/pan) (r:zd:17872/zd:16247/zd:11644) (q:draft)
tepanin = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:from the/from those) (d:<te> and <panin> written as one word, after a noun: from several of them) (j:te/panin) (r:zd:21543/zd:17538) (q:draft)
tepawl = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:the kind of/such as/and the like) (d:<te> and <pawl> written as one word, placed after a name, noun or clause: those of that kind, people or things such as these; after a personal name, that person and those with him) (j:te/pawl) (r:zd:25687/zd:25909/zd:21022) (q:draft)
tepawlpawl = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:the likes of/and such kinds/such as) (d:<tepawl>, those of that kind, with <pawl> doubled, placed after a noun or a quoted phrase: people or things of such kinds) (j:te/pawlpawl) (r:zd:16373) (q:draft, low confidence)
tepawlpen = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday) (w:such as these/that kind of) (d:<tepawl> and the topic marker <pen> written as one word, after a noun or phrase: as for people or things of that kind) (j:tepawl/pen) (r:zd:16433/zd:10840) (q:draft)
tepen = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (d:the plural <te> and the topic marker <pen> written as one word after a noun: marks several people or things as what the sentence is about) (j:te/pen) (r:zd:11844/zd:21552) (q:draft)
tepeuh = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (d:the plural <te> with <peuh>, any, written as one word after a noun or clause: those, any who are so) (j:te/peuh) (r:zd:11335) (q:draft, low confidence)
tepgawp = (i:1) (t:v) (f:health/everyday) (w:smoke heavily/smoke freely) (d:<tep>, smoke, with <gawp>, to excess, written as one word: smoke a great deal or without restraint) (j:tep/gawp) (r:zd:13112/zd:11675) (q:draft)
tepin = (i:1) (t:v) (f:health/body) (w:smoking/sucking) (d:<tep>, smoke or suck, with the linking <in>, written as one word: smoking, and then) (j:tep/in) (r:zd:14696) (q:draft, low confidence)
