thamding = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (d:<tham>, as much as, with <ding>, will, written as one word after a verb or describing word: will be so to a considerable degree, would well be, as in {lauhuai mahmah thamding}, would be very dangerous indeed) (j:tham/ding) (r:zd:14967) (q:draft, low confidence)
