thamin = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:even/so much as/all the more) (d:<tham>, as much as, with <in>: placed after a verb or after <zaw>, more, to stress the degree, even so much, far more; the exact force is not certain) (j:tham/in) (r:zd:23670) (q:draft, low confidence)
thamloh = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (j:thamlo) (r:zd:17883/zd:24545/zd:22785) (q:draft)
