thampi = (i:1) (t:n) (c:animal) (f:nature) (w:python) (d:a very large snake that kills by coiling around its prey and swallows it whole) (r:zd:12434/zd:11350) (q:draft)
thamtham = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:by far/far more/considerably) (d:placed after a comparison with <zaw> or after an amount: by a wide margin, well beyond) (r:zd:20875/zd:25353/zd:12487) (q:draft)
Thandwe = (i:1) (t:name) (c:city) (f:travel/politics) (w:Thandwe) (d:town in the south of Rakhine State in Myanmar) (r:ts:7742) (q:draft)
thaneihzah = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/body) (w:all one's strength/full strength) (d:<tha>, strength, and <neihzah>, as much as one has, written as one word: all the strength that one has; {ka thaneihzah in} is with all my strength) (j:tha/neihzah) (r:zd:23424/zd:16634) (q:draft)
