thangahna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/social) (w:encouragement/inspiration/source of strength) (d:<tha>, strength, with <ngahna>, getting: that from which a person gains strength or heart) (j:tha/ngahna) (r:zd:20772/zd:23443) (q:draft)
