Tongsan = (i:1) (t:name) (f:media) (w:Tongsan) (d:Tongsan Media Group, a Zomi news site that publishes in Zolai) (r:ts:3179/ts:11162) (q:draft)
Tongsial = (i:1) (t:name) (c:khua) (f:travel/social) (w:Tongsial) (d:a village of the Tedim area; often added after a personal name to show where the person comes from) (r:zd:23304/zd:22862/zd:15947) (q:draft)
