Topa Zeisu = (i:1) (t:name) (f:religion) (w:Lord Jesus/the Lord Jesus) (d:<Topa>, Lord, as a title before <Zeisu>, Jesus: the Lord Jesus, the usual way to name him in church writing) (r:zd:25454/zd:22544/zd:23394) (q:draft)
