tutunga = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:this time/on this occasion) (d:<tu>, this, with <tunga>: of this time, this time's, placed before a noun or before <pen>) (j:tu/tunga) (r:zd:25668/zd:15805) (q:draft, low confidence)
tutungpen = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time/everyday) (w:this time/as for this time) (d:<tu>, now, <tung>, time or occasion, and the topic marker <pen>, written as one word: this time, set against earlier times) (j:tu/tung/pen) (r:zd:12271/zd:16406) (q:draft)
