tuuk = (i:1) (t:n) (f:time/nature) (w:autumn/harvest season) (d:the season after the rains when the crops are gathered in; {tuuk anlak} is the autumn harvest and {tuuk kha} an autumn month) (r:zd:25393/zd:16340) (q:draft)
