tuunnu = (i:1) (t:n) (f:family) (w:mother) (d:poetic word for mother, used in songs and poems, often beside {zuapa}, father) (s:nu) (r:zd:23974/zd:24086) (q:draft)
tuzing = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:this morning) (d:<tu>, this, with the first part of <zingsang>, morning: this morning, also written {tuzing sang}; followed by <nai> and a number for the hour) (r:zd:25119/zd:25138/zd:25046) (q:draft)
tuzingsang = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:time) (w:this morning) (d:<tu> and <zingsang> written as one word: the morning of today) (j:tu/zingsang) (r:zd:12900/zd:15651) (q:draft)
