Ukraine = (i:1) (t:name) (c:land) (f:politics) (w:Ukraine) (d:country in eastern Europe, in the news for its war with Russia) (r:zd:25603/zd:25650/zd:9211) (q:draft)
ukte = (i:2) (t:n) (f:everyday/social) (w:lovers/enthusiasts/fans) (d:<uk> in another meaning, be fond of or keen on, with the plural <te>: those who are fond of the thing or activity named before it, as {music ukte}, music lovers, and {laigelh ukte}, those keen on writing; not those who rule) (r:zd:24381/zd:19788/zd:20359) (q:draft)
