umcihpah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/social) (w:surround at once/cordon off immediately) (d:<umcih> and <pah> written as one word: surround or seal off a place right away, said of police at the scene of an incident) (j:umcih/pah) (r:zd:20421/zd:12955) (q:draft)
umcipding = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/everyday) (w:to enclose/to cordon off/to fence in) (d:<um>, surround, <cip>, tightly, and <ding> written as one word: to close off a place all round, as with barriers) (j:um/cip/ding) (r:zd:15103/zd:13211) (q:draft)
