ungh = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (j:ung) (r:zd:24310/zd:20652/zd:23554) (q:draft)
ungin = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (d:<ung>, the verb-final marker for we without the hearer, and <in> written as one word: we being so, as we are, joining the clause to what follows) (j:ung/in) (r:zd:17426) (q:draft, low confidence)
