uppahpah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:believe at once/believe readily) (d:<up>, believe, and <pahpah>, at once, written as one word: believe a thing straight away, without thinking it over) (j:up/pahpah) (r:zd:13142/zd:16806) (q:draft)
