uteh = (i:1) (t:part) (f:everyday) (d:the plural marker <uh> and the particle <teh> written as one word at the end of a sentence, after {ding hi}: a statement about what they or you will surely come to do or see) (j:uh/teh) (r:zd:22911/zd:12432) (q:draft, low confidence)
