utlopi = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:unwillingly/against one’s will) (d:<ut>, want, and <lopi>, without, written as one word, mostly as {utlopi in}: without wanting to, against one’s will) (j:ut/lopi) (r:zd:22938/zd:12470) (q:draft)
