zonghuanpah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/media) (w:search for at once/set out searching) (d:<zong>, look for, with an element {-huan} of unclear meaning and <pah>, at once, written as one word: start searching for a missing or fleeing person straight away, mostly followed by <ngeingai>) (b:zong) (r:zd:12738/zd:19439) (q:draft, low confidence)
zongin = (i:1) (t:conj) (f:everyday) (w:although/but/yet/even if) (d:<zong>, also or even, with <in>: after a verb, although or even if; {ahi zongin} at the start of a clause is but or yet, and after each of several nouns it is whether or) (s:napi/hinapi)
zongkawikawi = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:search around/look everywhere for/search high and low) (d:<zong>, look for, with <kawikawi>, here and there, written as one word: go about searching in many places) (j:zong/kawikawi) (r:zd:18161/zd:14931/zd:26495) (q:draft)
zongkhiapah = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/work) (w:search out at once/track down immediately) (d:<zongkhia>, search out, with <pah>, at once, written as one word) (j:zongkhia/pah) (r:zd:15922/zd:15684) (q:draft)
zonglah = (i:1) (t:adv) (f:everyday) (w:even so/even then/and yet) (d:<zong>, also or even, and the emphatic <lah> written as one word: even in that case, and yet) (j:zong/lah) (r:zd:21869/zd:25089) (q:draft, low confidence)
zongpen = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:everyday) (w:also/too) (d:<zong> and <pen> written as one word after a noun or phrase: this one also, as the topic of the sentence) (j:zong/pen) (r:zd:12468/zd:15994/zd:18112) (q:draft)
zongsat = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/health) (w:be accustomed to/make a habit of/be addicted to) (d:do something so regularly that it becomes a habit, good or bad; {zongsat na} is a habit or an addiction) (r:zd:20963/zd:19455/zd:25909) (q:draft)
zongthei = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:can seek/can find/can earn) (d:<zong>, seek, and <thei>, able, written as one word: able to look for or get; {sum zongthei} is able to earn money, {ki zongthei} can be sought or found) (j:zong/thei) (r:zd:25923/zd:22584) (q:draft)
zongzo = (i:1) (t:v) (f:work/everyday) (w:be able to find/be able to earn) (d:<zong>, seek, and <zo>, be able, written as one word: manage to find or get; {sum zongzo} is be able to earn money) (j:zong/zo) (r:zd:11872) (q:draft)
