zonkul = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:must seek/need to look for) (d:<zon>, seek, and <kul>, must, written as one word: it is necessary to look for or to pursue) (j:zon/kul) (r:zd:23252/zd:22830) (q:draft)
zonnading = (i:1) (t:phrase) (f:work/everyday) (w:in order to seek/for finding) (d:<zon> and <nading> written as one word: for the purpose of seeking or earning something) (j:zon/nading) (r:zd:14652/zd:12470) (q:draft)
zonsa = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:everyday/work) (w:found/sought out/earned) (d:<zon>, seek, with the ending {-sa}, already done, written as one word: what someone has searched out, found or earned, as in {amau zonsa sum}, the money they have earned) (j:zon/sa) (r:zd:22464/zd:19159) (q:draft)
