zonsanlai = (i:1) (t:v) (f:politics/media) (w:still searching for/still hunting for) (d:<zonsan> and <lai.3>, still, written as one word: of the police, be still looking for a person) (j:zonsan/lai) (r:zd:13063/zd:17439) (q:draft)
zonsiam = (i:1) (t:adj) (f:work/politics) (w:skilled at searching/expert at finding) (d:<zon>, search, and <siam>, skilled, written as one word: trained to search for something, as bomb squads and sniffer dogs) (j:zon/siam) (r:zd:11897/zd:17147) (q:draft)
zontheihna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/work) (w:means of finding/way to search) (d:<zon> and <theihna> written as one word: being able to look for something, a means of finding or earning it; {sum zontheihna} is a way to earn money) (j:zon/theihna) (r:zd:11658/zd:12470) (q:draft)
