zonzia = (i:1) (t:n) (f:everyday/work) (w:way of seeking/way of earning) (d:<zon>, seek, with <zia>, manner: how something is looked for or earned; {sum zonzia} is the way of earning money) (b:zon) (r:zd:19676/zd:15268) (q:draft)
