zopkik = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/health) (w:rejoin/reattach/resume) (d:<zop>, join or continue, and <kik>, again, written as one word: join together again what was cut apart, or take up again what was broken off) (j:zop/kik) (r:zd:23777/zd:12600) (q:draft)
