zosiangthei = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/work) (w:be able to finish/get completed) (d:<zosiang>, finish completely, and <thei>, can, written as one word; {ki zosiangthei} is it could be completed) (j:zosiang/thei) (r:zd:20387/zd:17593) (q:draft)
