zotna = (i:1) (t:n) (f:social) (w:appeal/call/invitation) (d:a public appeal or call to a community, found in the headings of notices that ask people to take part in or support an event; the verb <zot> was not seen on its own) (r:zd:21664/zd:16235) (q:draft, low confidence)
