zusate = (i:1) (t:n) (c:animal) (f:nature/home) (w:mice/rats) (d:<zusa>, mouse or rat, with the plural <te>) (b:zusa) (r:zd:21347) (q:draft)
zut = (i:3) (t:v) (f:everyday/body) (w:rub/wipe/stroke) (d:pass the hand or a cloth over a surface, to rub the skin gently or to wipe something off, with nothing left on it as a coat; {puansiang tawh zut} is wipe with a clean cloth) (r:zd:19593/zd:21243) (q:draft, low confidence)
zuthawl = (i:2) (t:n) (f:food/everyday) (w:liquor bottle/bottle of alcohol) (d:<zu>, liquor, with <thawl>, bottle: an actual bottle of beer, whisky or other liquor, full or empty, with no thought of the marriage pledge) (r:zd:14694/zd:22267) (q:draft)
zutkha = (i:1) (t:v) (f:body/everyday) (w:dye/colour) (d:<zut>, smear or coat, with <kha>, happen to, written as one word: of hair, have put colour on it) (j:zut/kha) (r:zd:12466/zd:12302) (q:draft, low confidence)
zutsak = (i:1) (t:v) (f:body/everyday) (w:rub/wipe) (d:<zut>, rub or wipe, with the causing <sak>, written as one word: rub or wipe a part of another person) (j:zut/sak) (r:zd:14822) (q:draft, low confidence)
zuttan = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday/body) (w:cut through/slice through) (d:<zut>, rub or draw across, with <tan>, sever, written as one word: cut through by drawing something such as a wire across) (j:zut/tan) (r:zd:12457) (q:draft, low confidence)
zutuh = (i:1) (t:n) (f:food/health) (w:liquor/spirits) (d:strong alcoholic drink, <zu>, that is made and sold; in the articles a spirit that poisoned those who drank it) (r:zd:22805) (q:draft, low confidence)
zutzut = (i:1) (t:v) (f:everyday) (w:rub/stroke/keep wiping) (d:<zut> said twice: rub, stroke or smear again and again, as stroking a new car, rubbing oil on something, or swiping on a phone) (b:zut) (r:zd:24804/zd:19455/zd:25393) (q:draft)
